{"id":"G2098","lemma":"εὐαγγέλιον","transliteration":"euangelion","sayIt":"euangelion","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, neuter","gloss":"gospel","meaning":"εὐαγγέλιον, -ου, τό\n[in LXX for בְּשׂוֹרָה, 2Ki.4:10 18:22 18:25 * ;]\n1. in cl.,\n(a) a reward for good tidings (Hom.; pl., LXX, 2Ki.4:10);\n(b) in pl., εὐ. θύειν, to make a thank-offering for good tidings (Xen., al.).\n2. Later (Luc., Plut., al.), good tidings, good news; in NT of the good tidings of the kingdom of God and of salvation through Christ, the gospel: Mrk.1:15, Act.15:7, Rom.1:16, Gal.2:2, 1Th.2:4, al.; with genitive obj., τ. βασιλείας, Mat.4:23; τ. Χριστοῦ, Rom.15:19, al.; τ. κυρίου ἡμῶν Ἰησοῦ, 2Th.1:8; τ. υἱοῦ τ. θεοῦ, Rom.1:9; τ. δόξης τ. μακαρίου θεοῦ, 1Ti.1:11; τ. δόξης τ. Χριστοῦ, 2Co.4:4; of the author, τ. θεοῦ, Rom.15:16, al.; of the teacher, ἡμῶν, Rom.2:16, 2Co.4:3, 1Th.1:5, 2Ti.2:8; of the taught, τ. περιτομῆς, τ. ἀκροβυστίας, Gal.2:7; ἡ ἀλήθεια τοῦ εὐ., Gal.2:5, 14 Col.1:5; ἡ ἐλπὶς (πίστις) τοῦ εὐ., Col.1:23, Php.1:27 (see Cremer, 31 ff.; and on the later eccl. use of the word„ M, Th., 143 f.)\n(AS)","glosses":["gospel","good news","it","your"],"count":70,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-4","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"the gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mat-9","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"the gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mat-24","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mat-26","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-1","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"of the gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-1","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"the gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-1","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-8","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"the gospel's"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-10","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-13","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"the gospel"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-14","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"gospel","kjv":"gospel"}},{"chapter